{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39751","headline":"奉酬翁文尧员外驻南台见寄之什 · 黄滔","name":"奉酬翁文尧员外驻南台见寄之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人指南台山与川，大惊喜气异当年。\n花迎金册非时拆，月对琼杯此夜圆。\n我爱藏冰从夏结，君怜修竹到冬鲜。\n殷勤更抱鸣琴抚，爲忆秦儿识断弦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39751.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39751","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}